sequenceDiagram
    actor Phone as Phone User
    participant Browser as Tracker Browser
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Dashboard as Admin Dashboard
    Phone->>Browser: Press Start tracking
    Browser->>Browser: Request geolocation permission
    Phone-->>Browser: Allow permission
    loop Each GPS reading
      Browser->>Browser: Read latitude, longitude, speed, accuracy
      Browser->>API: POST /api/locations
      API->>API: Validate device and coordinate ranges
      API->>DB: INSERT location
      DB-->>API: Created location ID
      API->>DB: UPDATE device status
      API-->>Browser: 201 Created
      Dashboard->>API: GET /api/devices (refresh)
      API->>DB: Query latest locations
      DB-->>API: Device telemetry
      API-->>Dashboard: JSON devices and latest points
      Dashboard->>Dashboard: Update marker and telemetry
    end
